    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Duffy is delighted to present this exceptional residential site at Carrickavoley, Co. Monaghan to the market. Extending to approximately 0.68 acres (0.276 hectares), this prime parcel of rural land offers a fantastic opportunity to design and build a bespoke forever home in a highly scenic and sought-after countryside location.\n\nThe site is being sold with the benefit of outline planning permission (planning app ref number 2560133) for a substantial two storey style dwelling alongside a detached domestic garage, providing an ideal foundation for a premium family residence.\n\nSituated in the charming area of Carrickavoley, the site combines the peace of rural living with excellent accessibility. It is located just a short drive from Dundalk town centre and offers quick access to the M1 motorway network, ensuring an easy commute to both Dublin and Belfast.\n\nContact DNG Duffy today for more information.\n\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars do not form part of any offer or contract. All statements are provided for informational purposes only and should not be relied upon as representations of fact. Intending purchasers must independently verify the accuracy of each statement through inspection or other means. Neither the Vendor, Selling Agent, nor any of their employees have the authority to make or give any representation or warranty in relation to this property. Maps, plans, and boundaries are for illustrative purposes only and all dimensions are approximate."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Paul Clarke"
      }
